me the actor and the place as parameters; the excerpts, the reopen reason and the relative times are sample content.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened the Overview with ?tab=activity; the tab strip lists Views, Checks, Decisions, Requirements (only with a requirement source of the spec kind) and Activity, and Activity is the selected one. A version selected for comparison opens beside the timeline from 1024px and above it on narrow layouts (History: Version comparison).","The base state is a member who may read history: two Views changed since the last look, a timeline of an autosave and a Checkpoint, and six Review events. Variants show the lists loading, failing, empty or filtered, the history the member may not read, and records that cannot be read.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the Workbench chrome follows the Workbench language, so its text is baked here per Locale. Names, times, actors and excerpts are sample content."],"intent":"Show the Activity tab of the Overview as built from Adapter Widgets only: the Views changed since this browser last looked, the Workspace version timeline with its filters, and, apart from it, the latest Review events, so a person can see what moved without opening each View.","interactionRules":["The Views changed since this browser last looked are listed first, each with Compare with now and Open View; Compare finds the version that holds the revision last seen and opens the comparison from it to now, and says so beside the View when no saved version has it or the lookup fails.","The timeline is the Workspace version timeline, newest first and grouped by day; it filters by who changed it and by resource kind, can show Checkpoints only, and offers Create Checkpoint to a member who may. A filter that matches no loaded version says so and offers to change or clear the filters.","The version reads need the history read key: without it the timeline names the key instead and the Review events stay.","Review events are a separate list below the timeline and are never interleaved with the versions: the Workbench reads them live from the latest threads (comments, replies, submissions, resolutions, reopenings and re-anchoring), each linking to its thread, because the history never stores Review activity.","A list that is loading shows placeholders, a list that fails says so with Retry and never shows stale rows, and with no Review activity the list says so."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"2e2f88d6-7a95-424a-b3d4-4661d811ef13"},{"relation":"timeline-rows","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d701-6e2b-4f3a-9d5c-2b7e1f8a0c01"},{"relation":"comparison","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d702-6e2b-4f3a-9d5c-2b7e1f8a0c02"}],"requirements":["01a11a5e-199c-712f-b982-bb506c4954c8","01a11a5e-1a4b-72f7-8de9-1fc528aaf6eb","01a11e0d-db86-7890-ac42-5b4079364ad2","01a11a5e-0873-7976-8a48-a9a1a00e4b6d"]},"variants":{"checkpoints-only":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-199c-712f-b982-bb506c4954c8"],"state":{"tl-checkpoints":{"checked":true},"tl-v1-wrap":{"visible":false}}},"invalid-records":{"state":{"tl-days":{"visible":true},"tl-empty":{"visible":false},"tl-empty-filtered":{"visible":false},"tl-failed":{"visible":false},"tl-invalid":{"visible":true},"tl-loading":{"visible":false}}},"no-history-key":{"state":{"since":{"visible":false},"tl-body":{"visible":false},"tl-create":{"visible":false},"tl-filters":{"visible":false},"tl-nokey":{"visible":true}}},"review-empty":{"requirements":["01a11e0d-db86-7890-ac42-5b4079364ad2","01a11a5e-0873-7976-8a48-a9a1a00e4b6d"],"state":{"rv-empty":{"visible":true},"rv-list":{"visible":false}}},"review-failed":{"state":{"rv-failed":{"visible":true},"rv-list":{"visible":false}}},"review-loading":{"state":{"rv-list":{"visible":false},"rv-loading":{"visible":true}}},"since-failed":{"state":{"since-1-failed":{"visible":true}}},"since-unavailable":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-1a4b-72f7-8de9-1fc528aaf6eb"],"state":{"since-1-unavailable":{"visible":true}}},"timeline-empty":{"state":{"since":{"visible":false},"tl-days":{"visible":false},"tl-empty":{"visible":true},"tl-empty-filtered":{"visible":false},"tl-failed":{"visible":false},"tl-invalid":{"visible":false},"tl-loading":{"visible":false}}},"timeline-failed":{"state":{"tl-days":{"visible":false},"tl-empty":{"visible":false},"tl-empty-filtered":{"visible":false},"tl-failed":{"visible":true},"tl-invalid":{"visible":false},"tl-loading":{"visible":false}}},"timeline-filtered-empty":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-199c-712f-b982-bb506c4954c8"],"state":{"tl-days":{"visible":false},"tl-empty":{"visible":false},"tl-empty-filtered":{"visible":true},"tl-failed":{"visible":false},"tl-invalid":{"visible":false},"tl-loading":{"visible":false}}},"timeline-loading":{"state":{"tl-days":{"visible":false},"tl-empty":{"visible":false},"tl-empty-filtered":{"visible":false},"tl-failed":{"visible":false},"tl-invalid":{"visible":false},"tl-loading":{"visible":true}}}}}
